Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:58.60,Default,Cao Hong,0,0,0,,Chancellor, that man slew over fifty of our warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.62,0:02:16.18,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Who is that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.18,0:02:17.60,Default,Cao Hong,0,0,0,,I will go find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:18.64,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(319.818,471.377)}Cáo Hóng\NStyled: Zǐlián
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.55,0:02:35.84,Default,Cao Hong,0,0,0,,Enemy warrior, what is your name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:37.72,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(350.727,497.955)}Zhào Yún\NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:37.80,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,I am Zhao Zilong of Changshan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:41.98,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,I am Zhao Zilong of Changshan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.51,0:02:48.09,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,A tigerlike general.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:53.26,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I must capture him alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:58.60,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The Chancellor wants Zhao Zilong \Nunharmed and captured alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.15,0:03:03.42,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The Chancellor wants Zhao Zilong \Nunharmed and captured alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:07.04,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The Chancellor wants Zhao Zilong \Nunharmed and captured alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:13.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(849.987,507.378)}Zhāng Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.74,0:03:15.82,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:21.40,Thinking,Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Though not brothers, sworn by oath most golden,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:23.84,Thinking,Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}the meeting must have been long predestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:26.10,Thinking,Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Gallant and loyal to Hàn you remain,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:28.64,Thinking,Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}the soul of the Peach Garden you attain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:33.28,Thinking,Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}A lone rider of one spear breaking shields,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:37.94,Thinking,Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}with fierce valor, all foes are made to yield!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.94,0:03:42.72,Thinking,Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Colored and stained his war-gown in bloodshed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:47.37,Thinking,Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}At Dangyang is the heart most loyal set!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:52.14,Thinking,Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Zilong, Zilong, none in life could rival!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:56.98,Thinking,Song,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Legend utmost of Five Tigers' title!
